----------------------------------------------------------------
Project Git Notes                                              |
----------------------------------------------------------------
---Before starting work---                                     |
    -Open the project                                          |
    -Check the repository                                      |
        git status                                             |                         
    -Download the team’s latest work:                          |
        git pull --rebase origin main                          |
---After editing and testing---                                |
    -See which files changed                                   |
        git status                                             |                                
    -Review code changes                                       |
        git diff                                               |
    -Stage specific files                                      |
        git add game.lua                                       |
        git add world.lua                                      |
        git add Mole_Left_Right_Sheet.png                      |
    -Multiple files can be staged together                     |
        git add game.lua world.lua audio.lua                   |
    -Commit the changes                                        |
        git commit -m "Describe the completed change"          |
    -Download any changes made by teammates since work began   |
        git pull --rebase origin main                          |
    -Upload the commit to GitHub                               |
        git push origin main                                   |
----------------------------------------------------------------




## Controls

| Playdate control | Action |
|---|---|
| D-pad Left | Move and dig left |
| D-pad Right | Move and dig right |
| D-pad Down | Move and dig downward |
| A button | Start the game |
| A button or D-pad Down | Restart after game over |



## Technology

The project uses:

- Playdate SDK
- Playdate Lua API
- Lua
- Visual Studio Code
